# The glob lines the README once asked every .d2 to carry. `**` also reaches
# the vars block mdbrand appends for the brand's colours, and d2 refused the
# file with `"style" needs a value`: the luchando.org essays stopped building.
**.style.font-size: 32 # the size the author chose
(** -> **)[*].style.font-size: 32
**.style.stroke: "#555555"

sensor -> gateway -> platform
